================================================================================

btrix's own source is MIT, above. The published package also contains a
third-party component under a different licence, and this is not a
sublicensing of it:

  vendor/replaywebpage/
      ReplayWeb.page, by Webrecorder Software.
      AGPL-3.0-or-later. Full text in vendor/replaywebpage/LICENSE.

      Two files, `ui.js` and `replay/sw.js`, taken unmodified from the npm
      package `replaywebpage`. btrix does not link to, import, or call into
      them; it serves them to the browser as static files so an archive can
      be replayed without sending the browser to a public origin.

      The exact version, upstream location and file digests are recorded in
      vendor/replaywebpage/provenance.json, and scripts/vendor-replay.sh
      reproduces the copy.

      Those files are minified build output rather than the preferred form
      for modification. The corresponding source for the recorded version is
      published by Webrecorder at:

        https://github.com/webrecorder/replayweb.page
        https://www.npmjs.com/package/replaywebpage

The SPDX expression for the distribution as a whole is
`MIT AND AGPL-3.0-or-later`.
